<https://w3id.org/codo#Disease> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Conceptually broad term referring primarily to physical illness. Also used when particular disorders are not specified. Use a more specific term if possible. For general discussions of health impairment consider also the term HEALTH. (PSY)" .
<https://w3id.org/codo#Disease> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Disease refers to a disorder or abnormal condition of the body or mind that impairs normal functioning. Diseases can be caused by various factors, including pathogens (such as bacteria, viruses, or parasites), genetic mutations, environmental factors, lifestyle choices, or a combination of these factors." .
